  "title": "Bridging the Gap: Converting Read Text to Conversational Dialogue",
  "summary": "This paper introduces Prosodic Adjustment with Conversational Context (PACC) to convert read speech into natural conversational speech, improving accuracy and reducing computational overhead. CoSTA enhances spoken dialogue models by decoupling generation and synthesis token spaces, achieving faster and more efficient speech processing.",
